Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||06-16-2000||06:54 PM||||I have to say.. I prefer the fastback. then I see a beautiful aero notchback like DXR_DADs or Oreif's... and I realize I like them too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>never was too fond of the original coupe style.. (which is why I'd convert it to the aero style, and add a wing..) but they're still cool just because they're fieros.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000005||Pontiaddict||06-16-2000||07:15 PM||||I like the second style of notchback. They look like little Corvettes. The first version doesn't look as good since it has those black things on the bumpers. I seen those painted silver on a red car and it didn't look bad though. I don't like the wedge shape of the aero spoiler and the fastback looks okay but it makes the rear quarters look flat. I hear the fastback looks cool with the formula nose though. Plus the notchbacks look meaner from behind, and if you build the car right, thats what most people will see.<p>[This message has been edited by Pontiaddict (edited 06-16-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||Standard||06-16-2000||07:54 PM||||Aero Notchback w/ wing for the good ole' american muscle look.<P>Fastback for the sleek euro look...<P>Of course, I want one of each body style...||||reg||1
